  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIANIJA-BOLONG Watershed Water Resources Mobilization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to improve the availability of surface water resources in the Nanija Bolong watershed in order to create the conditions for the development of agro-sylvo-pastoral activities and to strengthen the resilience of ecosystems against climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
